# Keep the build context (and OpenShift binary upload) lean, and out of the image.
# The UI Containerfile runs `npm ci` fresh, so installed deps/build output must not
# be copied in.
#
# NOTE: this is a REPO-ROOT .dockerignore, so it applies to every image built from
# the root context — not just the UI. Do NOT exclude sibling component source dirs
# here (cpg-ingester/, mock-EHR/, automation/, platform/): those components build
# from the root context (e.g. `COPY cpg-ingester/ ...`) and excluding them breaks
# their builds with "no such file or directory (filtered out using .dockerignore)".
# Only exclude things no root-context build needs.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
working/
.git
.claude
**/*.log
**/mlflow.db
**/.DS_Store
dev_docs/
docs/
